---
source: crates/agentgateway/src/import/litellm.rs
description: src/tests/import/litellm/mcp-server-stdio-invalid.yaml
---
source: litellm
config:
  config:
    database:
      url: "sqlite://data.db"
  gateways:
    default:
      port: 4000
  ui:
    gateways: default
  llm:
    gateways: default
    models:
      - name: gpt-4o
        provider: openAI
        params:
          model: gpt-4o
    policies:
      apiKey:
        keys:
          - key: sk-test-master-key
        mode: strict
  mcp:
    gateways: default
    targets:
      - stdio:
          cmd: npx
          args: []
          env: {}
        name: fs-with-headers
    policies:
      apiKey:
        keys:
          - key: sk-test-master-key
        mode: strict
findings:
  - sourcePath: "model_list[0]"
    status: exact
    message: Imported model deployment for gpt-4o
  - sourcePath: general_settings.master_key
    status: approximate
    message: "Mapped LiteLLM's master_key (an admin-equivalent credential, not a per-user virtual key) to strict Authorization Bearer authentication; LiteLLM also accepts other credential headers. Per-user virtual-key migration needs LiteLLM's database state, not config.yaml alone."
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.fs_with_headers
    status: approximate
    message: "Renamed \"fs_with_headers\" to \"fs-with-headers\" to satisfy agentgateway's Gateway-API-style MCP target name pattern (lowercase letters, digits, '-', '.'; no underscores)"
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.fs_with_headers
    status: unsupported
    message: LiteLLM static_headers has no meaning for a stdio MCP target and was not applied
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.fs_with_headers
    status: approximate
    message: "Mapped LiteLLM MCP server to agentgateway target \"fs-with-headers\""
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.fs_bad_args
    status: approximate
    message: "Renamed \"fs_bad_args\" to \"fs-bad-args\" to satisfy agentgateway's Gateway-API-style MCP target name pattern (lowercase letters, digits, '-', '.'; no underscores)"
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.fs_bad_args
    status: manual
    message: LiteLLM stdio args must be an array of strings and was not emitted
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.fs_bad_env
    status: approximate
    message: "Renamed \"fs_bad_env\" to \"fs-bad-env\" to satisfy agentgateway's Gateway-API-style MCP target name pattern (lowercase letters, digits, '-', '.'; no underscores)"
  - sourcePath: mcp_servers.fs_bad_env
    status: manual
    message: LiteLLM stdio env must be an object and was not emitted
  - sourcePath: general_settings.master_key
    status: approximate
    message: "Mirrored the inbound API-key policy onto the MCP gateway so /mcp also requires master_key; LiteLLM's own DB-managed per-key MCP grants were not available here and were not applied"
